It is almost five o'clock in the afternoon.
I unlock my bicycle.
Then I ride through the streets of Berlin.
The evening is cool, but beautiful.
The streets are very busy today.
But I gladly ride this route.
I can ride fast here.
My backpack is a little heavy.
I want to play badminton this evening.
I want to meet new people in the city.
The ride is really short.
After ten minutes, I see a large sports hall.
The badminton club is there.
I stop and get off.
I park my bicycle.
I am on time.
The training begins at half past five.
I walk to the entrance of the hall.
